# Privacy Policy for Hermes

**Last Updated:** June 1, 2026

## Introduction

This Privacy Policy explains how Hermes ("the Bot") handles information when users interact with the Bot through Discord.

## Information Collection

Hermes does not permanently collect, store, sell, rent, or share personal information.

The Bot may temporarily process information necessary to respond to commands and provide its functionality, including:

* Discord user IDs
* Discord server IDs
* Messages or command inputs sent to the Bot

This information is processed only for the duration required to fulfill a request and is not retained by Hermes.

## Third-Party Services

Hermes operates through Discord and may utilize third-party services necessary for functionality. Users are subject to the privacy policies and terms of those respective services.

## Data Security

Because Hermes does not permanently store user data, no user database is maintained by the Bot.

## Children's Privacy

Hermes is not directed toward children under the age required by Discord's Terms of Service. Users must comply with Discord's age requirements.

## Changes to This Privacy Policy

This Privacy Policy may be updated from time to time. Any updates will be reflected by changing the "Last Updated" date above.

